    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d812">

                <pb facs="1105" n="969" sameAs="frus:frus1929v01/pg969"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">714.1515/973: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hawks</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-11-13T12:00:00-06:00">November 13,
                        1929—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 3:35 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>146. Referring to Department’s telegram of November 12, 5 p.m.<anchor n="43"
                        xml:id="d812-f1"/></p>
                <p>The Minister for Foreign Affairs has informed me that it will be convenient for
                    Guatemala to have the conference convened on December <pb facs="1106" n="970"
                        xml:id="pg970"/> 15th. The Guatemalan delegation will consist of Carlos
                    Salazar as delegate and Carlos Salazar, Junior, and Silva Pena as
                    secretaries.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Honduras.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hawks</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
